  "topic": "document_highlight",
  "subtopic": "symbols",
  "title": "Macro names and arguments",
  "summary": "A macro highlights at its definition, its expansions, the conditionals testing it and its `#undef`",
  "prose": "A name written in a macro argument highlights where it is written; a name the macro's replacement spells highlights the whole invocation. A macro used in another macro's replacement highlights neither there nor at that macro's invocations.",
  "status": "supported",
